{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRankCriterion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRankCriterion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.SymmetricCoxeter","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.PermLength","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhat","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.BruhatReflection"],"declarations":35,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.bruhatLe_of_rk_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.bruhatLe_of_rk_le","kind":"theorem","line":682,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L682-L684","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.bruhatLe_of_rk_le_aux","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.bruhatLe_of_rk_le_aux","kind":"theorem","line":615,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L615-L680","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.bruhatLe_mul_simple_of_isRightDescent_An","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.bruhatLe_mul_simple_of_isRightDescent_An","kind":"theorem","line":602,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L602-L611","doc":"Type-`A` form of `bruhatLe_mul_simple_of_isRightDescent`, hypotheses discharged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.eq_one_of_all_asc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.eq_one_of_all_asc","kind":"theorem","line":596,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L596-L598","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.eq_one_of_rk_one_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.eq_one_of_rk_one_le","kind":"theorem","line":556,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L556-L577","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_one","kind":"theorem","line":545,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L545-L554","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_min","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_min","kind":"theorem","line":532,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L532-L543","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_le_of_asc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_le_of_asc","kind":"theorem","line":510,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L510-L524","doc":"**The mixed case.**  If `u` ASCENDS across the cut, right multiplication of `w` by `s_j`\nstays under `u` unchanged.  Nothing is assumed of `w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_mono_desc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_mono_desc","kind":"theorem","line":493,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L493-L508","doc":"**Descent-direction monotonicity.**  If `u` descends across the cut, right multiplication by\n`s_j` preserves rank domination.  Nothing is assumed of `w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.IncreasingOn.mono_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.IncreasingOn.mono_right","kind":"theorem","line":473,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L473-L475","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_eq_of_index_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_eq_of_index_ge","kind":"theorem","line":464,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L464-L471","doc":"Past the last index there is nothing left to count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_of_endpoints","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_of_endpoints","kind":"theorem","line":446,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L446-L462","doc":"**The interpolation bridge.**  If a rank inequality holds at the two ENDPOINTS of a window\non which the dominated permutation increases, it holds at every index INSIDE the window.\n\nNothing is assumed of `w` — the upper bound it needs (`rk w i m ≤ min (rk w b m, rk w a m +\n(i-a))`) holds for any permutation, being monotonicity plus \"at most one value per position\".\nOnly `u` must increase, and only across the window.\n\nThis is the step that turns Mathas 3.7's row-cut rank comparison into the every-index\ncomparison Ehresmann's criterion consumes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_ge_min_of_increasingOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_ge_min_of_increasingOn","kind":"theorem","line":419,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L419-L444","doc":"**The interpolation step.**  Inside a window on which `u` increases, the rank matrix is\npinned from below by the two endpoints: the values below `m` come FIRST, so by index `i` you\nhave collected either all of them or one per position, whichever runs out sooner.\n\nThis is the only place row-standardness is used: `dOf t` increases across each row block\nexactly when `t` is row standard. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_eq_add_of_all_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_eq_add_of_all_lt","kind":"theorem","line":393,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L393-L417","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.IncreasingOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.IncreasingOn","kind":"def","line":388,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L388-L391","doc":"`u` is strictly increasing across the index window `[a, b)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_add_sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_add_sub","kind":"theorem","line":369,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L369-L385","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.card_filter_val_Ico","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.card_filter_val_Ico","kind":"theorem","line":354,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L354-L367","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mono_index","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mono_index","kind":"theorem","line":347,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L347-L352","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_of_bruhatLe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_of_bruhatLe","kind":"theorem","line":320,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L320-L331","doc":"**`BruhatLe` implies the rank inequality** — the easy half of Ehresmann's criterion,\nfor the symmetric group.\n\nThis is what a consumer of Dipper–James 3.7 needs for the CONVERSE implication\n(`d(s) ≤ d(t) → s ⊵ t`): compose it with the specialisation of the rank inequality to the\nrow cuts and with `DominanceIsBruhat.domRel_iff_rankAt`.  No reflection order appears, so\nthis route does not wait on `BruhatLe → ReflLe` (bean `qou-3k66`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_of_sublist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_le_of_sublist","kind":"theorem","line":287,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L287-L317","doc":"**The easy direction of Ehresmann's criterion**, in the form the subword definition\ngives it: a subword of a reduced word has a pointwise-larger rank matrix.\n\nThe induction is on the reduced word from the RIGHT: `ω = ρ ++ [j]` splits a subword as\n`l₁ ++ l₂` with `l₂` empty or `[j]`, which are exactly the two rank steps proved above —\n`rk_mul_simple_le` when the last letter is dropped, `rk_mul_simple_mono` when it is kept. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.isReduced_of_isReduced_concat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.isReduced_of_isReduced_concat","kind":"theorem","line":266,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L266-L284","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_simple_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_simple_mono","kind":"theorem","line":252,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L252-L261","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_simple_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_simple_le","kind":"theorem","line":243,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L243-L250","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.permCoxeterSystem_simple'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.permCoxeterSystem_simple'","kind":"theorem","line":236,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L236-L241","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_mono","kind":"theorem","line":212,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L212-L232","doc":"**Step B.**  A rank domination survives right multiplication by `s_j`, provided the\nDOMINATED permutation ascends across the cut.  Nothing is assumed of the other one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_le","kind":"theorem","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L197-L210","doc":"**Step A.**  If `w` ascends across the cut then right-multiplying by `s_j` can only\nlower the rank matrix. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_succ_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_succ_succ","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L189-L195","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_castSucc_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_castSucc_succ","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L181-L187","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_cut","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_cut","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L140-L177","doc":"**At the cut `i = j + 1`**, right multiplication by `s_j` replaces the value at\nposition `j` by the value at position `j + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_of_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_of_ne","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L118-L138","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_mul_swap_eq","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L106-L116","doc":"Right multiplication permutes POSITIONS: the swap moves into the position condition\nand leaves the value condition alone. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_zero","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L103-L104","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_succ","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L82-L101","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_eq_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk_eq_card","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L74-L80","doc":"`rk` as a cardinality rather than a sum of indicators -- the form a consumer counting\ntableau labels wants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.BruhatRank.rk","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/BruhatRankCriterion.lean#L71-L72","signatureChunk":0}]}